## About

Reef Telecom is an environmentally responsible telecom sourcing company specializing in professionally refurbished networking and telecommunications equipment. Based in the US, we serve businesses with over 27 years of combined secondary market and ITAD experience. We are committed to promoting environmentally-conscious equipment usage through its lifecycle.

